     * {@code PREMIUM_METRO}, {@code PREMIUM_REGIONAL}, {@code STANDARD_METRO} or
     * {@code STANDARD_REGIONAL}. TIER is {@code PREMIUM} when the {@link #membershipLevel(Owner)
